{"id": "EUVD-2026-81989", "enisaUuid": "8355eb19-ca26-3d31-b9b3-90ca6c75cddd", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nHID: steam: Reject short reads\n\nSteam Controller FEATURE reports encode the size of the message in the\nmessage itself. Previously we were trusting that the size reported matched\nthe size we actually read, leading to a potential issue with short reads.\nInstead, we should actually verify the length of the read.", "datePublished": "2026-09-17T16:08:42", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:51:01", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/37cb84b992718924dc334ce584c703333a6a4217", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cbcc9b0ccbbd33125ffc9479fb8f69ac969fe55c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f694ea0ead544080949e409a7c6885ee1fc77a98", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/93c5cc35bcd9f62db589a21945b49691dccdd99d", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/33ff7b49c38b39b1f3d27db508ac0720fb25c08a"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-90328", "GHSA-px28-m9f6-9x2m"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "04111977-545e-3b2c-98a7-be16cdd08b52", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "c164d6abf3841ffacfdb757c10616f9cb1f67276 <f694ea0ead544080949e409a7c6885ee1fc77a98"}, {"id": "04e44c52-37a5-3210-a6ac-bf561eb4c781", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "2ab78fca-3064-30c8-baba-767d803392b6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "c164d6abf3841ffacfdb757c10616f9cb1f67276 <37cb84b992718924dc334ce584c703333a6a4217"}, {"id": "2d2199e0-50d2-3751-afff-43c3a7a29e17", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "c164d6abf3841ffacfdb757c10616f9cb1f67276 <93c5cc35bcd9f62db589a21945b49691dccdd99d"}, {"id": "2eec6ea2-c518-38af-826d-fd0dc8e3425d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"